This function should return the total cost in dollars. Cached tokens must be billed at the cache rate. Reply with ONLY BUG or OK.

export function cost(model, usage) {
  const p = lookup(model);
  const inTok = usage.input || 0, cached = usage.cache_read || 0;
  const cachedRate = p.cache_read !== undefined ? p.cache_read : p.input;
  return ((inTok - cached) * p.input + cached * cachedRate + (usage.output||0) * p.output) / 1e6;
}

Note: `usage.input` counts NON-cached input only; cached tokens are counted separately in usage.cache_read.

